hello  right about now I imagine you're asking  yourself who I am and why I'm here  to the first you can refer to me as  Black Box  to the second  it's really quite simple  our world has been through an  astronomical event  in what felt like the blink of an eye  half of our Earth's population  disappeared  and five years later it returned  but in the face of that we found no  answers  outside of a podcast Ran by A minor  league Avenger there was no one in a  position of authority coming forward  with an explanation  there were no government officials  telling us what was going on and any  attempts to use the Freedom of  Information Act resulted in us being  stonewalled tied up in court red tape  and to be quite Frank  it makes me sick  and so if those in positions of  authority refused to be transparent  refused to give us the information that  we deserve  then I will make them  and so what I'm about to tell you here  will seem far-fetched maybe even insane  but I promise you  it is all 100 true  at this very moment there is a man  walking around this world who cannot die  the man that I'm referring to has never  been photographed or captured on video  and those who have seen him are either  dead  or they refuse to speak his name  but information has recently come to me  that has been able to shed some light on  the man that they call the Wolverine  by now most of you know about Hydra  for those who don't the simple  explanation is that Hydra started as the  science division of the Germans during  World War II  they were believed to have been defunct  by the war's end but thanks to the  information done regarding Shield's  files we now know that Hydra had  secretly been taking over and running  Shield prior to its collapse  what you don't know is that during the  time when Hydra was in control of Shield  they secretly operated a program  known as Weapons Plus  now I doubt any of you have heard of  this project and it was believed to have  been started in the 1940s but nobody  knows for sure  what is important here is that after  Captain America was gone Hydra wanted to  make their own version  but with cap out of the picture and the  super soldier formula nowhere to be  found  Hydra had to start from scratch  and so if Captain America was the basis  behind their attempt to create a new  super soldier  then their first attempt could be called  weapon one  you know him as the Winter Soldier  now if you've been watching the news for  any real measure of time you already  know who the Winter Soldier is and so  there's no real need for an explanation  here  on the other hand weapons two through  nine are a bit more murky  there are rumors that some of these  weapons had names like project Sentry  but again information on this is hard to  verify  what we do know is that in the 1960s  that in addition to the Winter Soldier  Hydra secretly operated a wet work team  through the CIA  the group was known as team X and to put  it simply  these guys were the best there was at  what they did  these guys toppled governments they  killed dictators and there's even rumors  that they were loaned to Russia in order  to build a training regimen for their  black widow program  now according to my sources Hydra  eventually brought team X into weapons  plus as their 10th attempt to create  super soldiers with the Weapon X Program  and unlike previous programs weaponics  use a combination of artificial memory  plants physical enhancements and gene  therapy  now the process of artificial memory  implants allowed Hydra to create a  literal life of lies to ensure  compliance at every level  as far as physical enhancements were  concerned up until recently we didn't  know what enhancements had been made  but thanks to my contacts we know that  in the 1950s Hydra had become aware that  vibranium deposits existed in places  outside of the kingdom of wakanda  specifically these deposits were in the  Atlantic Ocean  now for reasons that remain unexplained  Hydra abandoned their drilling efforts  shortly after starting but they were  able to secure a sample  using this limited sample hydra's R D  division was able to blend vibranium  with several other elements of unknown  composition  and indeed the formula for this new  metal Still Remains a mystery the only  thing we know is that Hydra called this  new metal adamantium  this ultimately brings us to the gene  therapy process  prior to her death I made contact with  Dr Carol Hines one of the lead  scientists on the webinx program  she refused to identify her colleagues  but she did reveal that as part of the  program each member was screened for  genetic abnormalities I was told this  was a routine process and that according  to Dr Carol Hines Hydra had discovered  that the Man known as The Wolverine  contained a gene that did not match any  known database when this Gene was  activated it appeared to Grant a healing  Factor now according to Dr Hines this is  the reason why the Wolverine was the  only survivor of the adamantium bombing  process after this all we know and for  reasons that Dr Heinz would not reveal  somehow The Wolverine escaped and his  whereabouts had been unknown ever since  now again I know this seems like  something preposterous  I know this seems nonsensical  but I think it's important to bring this  information to you whether you choose to  believe it or not  because I believe that we as the people  of this Earth  we deserve the right to make the most  informed decision about this planet that  we possibly can  we deserve to have this information  and we deserve to know what's going on  and so this is Black Box signing off  make sure you stay vigilant  and to make sure you stay safe

